WEBVTT

00:01:42.840 --> 00:01:44.740
You're pathetic.

00:01:45.540 --> 00:01:48.430
Ain't you got nothin'
better to do on a Sunday?

00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:49.740
I'm broke!

00:01:52.270 --> 00:01:52.900
And--

00:01:54.950 --> 00:01:57.380
You're outta your head
worryin' over the manager.

00:01:59.930 --> 00:02:00.900
Am not.

00:02:01.230 --> 00:02:02.240
Are too.

00:02:02.960 --> 00:02:04.350
A lot's happened
this year...

00:02:04.730 --> 00:02:05.990
She quit
bein' Manager...

00:02:06.050 --> 00:02:08.610
and she almost stopped
bein' an Otonashi.

00:02:15.100 --> 00:02:17.510
So stop moping
around here.

00:02:17.830 --> 00:02:21.030
Go out and make yourself into
somebody she can rely on.

00:02:40.470 --> 00:02:42.260
She's so energetic today!

00:02:42.730 --> 00:02:46.080
I guess you get more
chipper with exercise.

00:02:46.510 --> 00:02:50.760
Now that you mention it, Kyoko
hasn't played tennis in ages.

00:02:51.070 --> 00:02:52.040
What happened?

00:02:53.170 --> 00:02:56.200
I shouldn't say. The
whole affair is so sordid.

00:02:56.280 --> 00:02:57.820
--What is!?
--Mrs. Ichinose!

00:02:59.450 --> 00:03:01.160
This isn't anything to
spread gossip about!

00:03:01.320 --> 00:03:03.220
It's nothin' to
be ashamed of.

00:03:03.690 --> 00:03:07.170
Think of the manager!
She's finally put it behind her.

00:03:07.380 --> 00:03:11.910
So let's just keep it quiet.
You know how sensitive she is.

00:03:13.420 --> 00:03:14.820
Did I miss something?

00:03:14.920 --> 00:03:15.910
The manager--

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:16.580
Mrs. Ichinose!

00:03:18.040 --> 00:03:20.030
It doesn't involve
you, Mitaka.

00:03:20.510 --> 00:03:23.730
If it's about Ms. Otonashi
then I'm deeply involved.

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:27.360
I noticed it myself.

00:03:28.280 --> 00:03:31.540
She is haunted by some
deep-seated anxiety.

00:03:32.670 --> 00:03:33.360
You can tell?

00:03:33.820 --> 00:03:34.570
Observe--

00:03:35.580 --> 00:03:39.880
The way she swings on her return
betrays her heart's unrest.

00:03:42.030 --> 00:03:43.750
That's a pro for ya!

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:45.950
Tennis is a
spiritual sport.

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:48.100
You're full of it.

00:03:48.860 --> 00:03:49.910
Is it obvious?

00:03:51.700 --> 00:03:55.290
Everyone's over here!
What are you all talking about?

00:04:02.510 --> 00:04:03.530
Is everything all right?

00:04:03.850 --> 00:04:04.820
Everything's fine.

00:04:04.910 --> 00:04:08.320
How does it feel to
work up a sweat?

00:04:08.580 --> 00:04:09.880
--Great!
--Ms. Otonashi?

00:04:14.190 --> 00:04:16.840
May I share the
burden of your troubles?

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:20.780
Quit the sweet-talk!

00:04:21.460 --> 00:04:23.370
Godai, I thought
you'd left.

00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:27.560
Quit clinging to the fence
like some old lizard.

00:04:27.810 --> 00:04:28.740
It's a free country.

00:04:29.010 --> 00:04:31.200
But it's disgusting.
You're young. Get a life.

00:04:31.270 --> 00:04:32.390
Makes you look
like a sicko.

00:04:32.470 --> 00:04:33.830
You're a poor
excuse for a man!

00:04:35.340 --> 00:04:36.310
You made your point.

00:04:37.550 --> 00:04:39.260
I won't stay where
I'm not wanted.

00:04:40.210 --> 00:04:40.900
Godai.

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:46.510
You could stay
and play tennis.

00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:48.490
Boy, can I!?

00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:55.760
Wow, I never thought I'd
actually get to play!

00:04:56.070 --> 00:04:59.390
I'm not sure. This is
supposed to be ladies only.

00:04:59.460 --> 00:05:02.320
You can bend the rules.
We're saving a life.

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:03.260
She's right!

00:05:03.570 --> 00:05:07.380
Let him work off his frustrations
here before society suffers.

00:05:08.380 --> 00:05:09.360
Mrs. Ichinose!

00:05:10.140 --> 00:05:12.440
Let's get it over with.
Get yourself a racket.

00:05:13.010 --> 00:05:14.240
You mean, play with you?

00:05:14.320 --> 00:05:15.640
Who else?

00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:18.530
But you'll beat the
pants off him, Coach.

00:05:19.010 --> 00:05:21.750
I hate a match where
the outcome is obvious.

00:05:23.320 --> 00:05:25.220
How about mixed doubles?

00:05:25.520 --> 00:05:26.570
"Doubles"?

00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:30.320
Good idea! Ms. Otonashi
and I will be one pair.

00:05:30.670 --> 00:05:33.260
She should be my partner
to balance your skill.

00:05:34.260 --> 00:05:35.590
You're saying I
should play?

00:05:36.530 --> 00:05:37.460
What do you think?

00:05:37.740 --> 00:05:40.130
The Coach still
needs a handicap.

00:05:43.570 --> 00:05:44.530
"Handicap."

00:05:44.920 --> 00:05:45.960
Hope we do well.

00:05:46.050 --> 00:05:47.200
So do I.

00:05:48.210 --> 00:05:49.940
You pretty much
know the rules, right?

00:05:50.280 --> 00:05:51.120
More or less.

00:05:52.150 --> 00:05:53.880
You know the rules, right?

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:54.840
What rules?

00:06:02.170 --> 00:06:03.140
"What rules"!?

00:06:03.240 --> 00:06:04.450
I know nothing.

00:06:04.760 --> 00:06:08.450
What have you been doing at
the club all this time!?

00:06:09.070 --> 00:06:12.390
Have you EVER
seen me practice?

00:06:14.400 --> 00:06:14.930
Never.

00:06:15.340 --> 00:06:19.010
That's right. Who cares
who wins the dumb game.

00:06:19.340 --> 00:06:21.510
Just as long as it
cheers the manager up.

00:06:23.210 --> 00:06:26.620
Manager? Let's really
give this our best shot.

00:06:26.880 --> 00:06:27.320
Okay!

00:06:27.690 --> 00:06:29.880
Let's make it count!
Play!

00:06:32.260 --> 00:06:32.740
I got it--

00:06:41.440 --> 00:06:42.200
The winner.

00:06:42.400 --> 00:06:43.520
15-Love!

00:06:43.830 --> 00:06:45.090
What's that!?

00:06:46.110 --> 00:06:48.150
I hit it over
the net, didn't I?

00:06:49.180 --> 00:06:53.740
Godai, I was supposed to
return the first serve.

00:06:54.340 --> 00:06:57.570
Really?
I didn't know.

00:06:58.420 --> 00:07:01.570
I'm sorry. I guess
I'm ruining our chances.

00:07:01.780 --> 00:07:04.210
Don't worry.
I'll cover for you.

00:07:06.220 --> 00:07:09.950
He don't even know the rules!
We may pull this one off!

00:07:12.260 --> 00:07:15.020
Mrs. Ichinose
I'll take it from here!

00:07:15.110 --> 00:07:15.890
It's all yours.

00:07:16.130 --> 00:07:16.620
I got--

00:07:17.530 --> 00:07:18.430
Get the next one!

00:07:18.610 --> 00:07:20.720
Since we've got some
time, let's gossip.

00:07:21.770 --> 00:07:25.260
They may force the
manager to quit herjob.

00:07:26.450 --> 00:07:26.930
You hit it!

00:07:27.420 --> 00:07:30.110
Her folks want
her to get remarried--

00:07:32.950 --> 00:07:34.070
It's good!

00:07:35.150 --> 00:07:37.620
See, Godai? You can
do it if you try!

00:07:40.170 --> 00:07:41.590
They got us good!

00:07:41.760 --> 00:07:44.200
This remarriage--who do
they have in mind?

00:07:44.630 --> 00:07:46.590
Here comes the serve.

00:07:49.400 --> 00:07:52.000
I don't think they've
picked out a groom yet--

00:07:52.610 --> 00:07:54.320
I see. And?

00:07:54.880 --> 00:07:56.740
First, they want her
to use her maiden name.

00:07:56.840 --> 00:07:59.610
Next, they want her to cut her
connection with the Otonashis.

00:08:00.210 --> 00:08:00.830
Makes sense.

00:08:01.140 --> 00:08:03.130
Move back, Godai!
Come forward, Ms. Otonashi!

00:08:05.950 --> 00:08:06.680
What for?

00:08:07.380 --> 00:08:10.010
Ms. Otonashi. I understand
your problem perfectly.

00:08:11.130 --> 00:08:14.620
Listen to your parents.
Quit as manager...

00:08:14.700 --> 00:08:16.520
and start from square one.

00:08:16.590 --> 00:08:17.450
What was that?

00:08:18.830 --> 00:08:21.360
I want you to be
my lifetime partner.

00:08:36.050 --> 00:08:36.830
"Partner"?

00:08:49.990 --> 00:08:51.550
You heard it!?

00:08:52.040 --> 00:08:53.560
Think it was a proposal!?

00:08:53.640 --> 00:08:56.620
Oh, to be young again!

00:09:05.680 --> 00:09:07.570
You just talk too much!

00:09:07.950 --> 00:09:10.370
Maybe, but I know
who I'm talkin' to.

00:09:10.790 --> 00:09:12.910
It's your conversation
partner that's the problem!

00:09:13.660 --> 00:09:16.950
This won't do anything to
relieve the manager's stress!

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:22.060
You're so naive. She won't solve
her problems by ignoring them.

00:09:22.360 --> 00:09:25.450
Right. She has to think
seriously about remarriage.

00:09:27.070 --> 00:09:28.720
Who's she supposed to marry!?

00:09:31.140 --> 00:09:34.490
Nobody's asked how the
manager feels about this!

00:09:35.450 --> 00:09:36.410
How does she feel?

00:09:36.600 --> 00:09:37.900
I'm all ears.

00:09:38.970 --> 00:09:41.770
You see, she's not just
rebelling against her parents.

00:09:42.240 --> 00:09:43.300
The manager--

00:09:47.980 --> 00:09:49.150
She--

00:09:51.300 --> 00:09:54.950
S-She still
l-loves S-Soichiro.

00:09:56.590 --> 00:09:58.320
Man, the truth hurts.

00:09:59.440 --> 00:10:02.090
So she can't just give in
to other people's desires.

00:10:14.820 --> 00:10:19.180
Ms. Otonashi, Godai may
have scored on me today...

00:10:19.390 --> 00:10:22.290
but I'm serious about you
being my partner in the future.

00:10:22.350 --> 00:10:23.070
Mitaka!

00:10:25.300 --> 00:10:29.090
Coach Mitaka, I've thought
this over carefully.

00:10:29.820 --> 00:10:30.340
And?

00:10:31.400 --> 00:10:34.980
I'm sorry.
I just can't.

00:10:38.810 --> 00:10:40.640
B-But why not!?

00:10:42.340 --> 00:10:45.960
I--   I--

00:10:49.150 --> 00:10:53.050
I'll never be good enough to
partner with you professionally!

00:10:56.350 --> 00:10:58.750
I just don't have the confidence.

00:11:00.820 --> 00:11:01.550
So I can't!

00:11:47.380 --> 00:11:48.640
Good morning!

00:11:49.300 --> 00:11:50.730
My what a beautiful day!

00:11:50.940 --> 00:11:52.500
You're quick to recover.

00:11:55.020 --> 00:11:55.730
Manager!

00:11:57.180 --> 00:11:59.280
Coach Mitaka's here
to pick you up.

00:12:00.020 --> 00:12:00.840
H-He what!?

00:12:01.580 --> 00:12:02.680
Manager!

00:12:02.810 --> 00:12:03.460
Coming!

00:12:07.220 --> 00:12:09.710
Godai! Good morning!

00:12:10.960 --> 00:12:14.450
Manager, you're not going on
a date with Mitaka, are you?

00:12:14.560 --> 00:12:16.900
"A date"?
It's nothing like that!

00:12:17.430 --> 00:12:20.450
He's just taking me
out for a drive, that's all.

00:12:22.230 --> 00:12:23.950
A date if I've
ever heard of one!

00:12:28.780 --> 00:12:30.600
Don't be stand-offish.
Come on in!

00:12:31.340 --> 00:12:33.830
I-It's okay. We'll be on
our way soon anyway.

00:12:34.310 --> 00:12:35.680
Thanks for waiting.

00:12:39.220 --> 00:12:39.880
After you.

00:12:51.510 --> 00:12:53.460
I won't keep
her too long.

00:12:53.700 --> 00:12:54.800
Take your time!

00:12:54.880 --> 00:12:55.960
See you later!

00:13:05.120 --> 00:13:06.410
I gotta hear this!

00:13:06.890 --> 00:13:08.880
That was Coach Mitaka, right!?

00:13:08.950 --> 00:13:10.310
It sure was!

00:13:10.550 --> 00:13:13.340
Didn't he propose yesterday?

00:13:14.030 --> 00:13:16.760
I want you to be
my life time partner.

00:13:19.770 --> 00:13:21.890
I was sure he did, but--

00:13:21.960 --> 00:13:23.130
What did Kyoko--?

00:13:23.270 --> 00:13:24.480
She didn't get it.

00:13:24.830 --> 00:13:28.090
Oh, please! She was just
playing hard to get!

00:13:28.680 --> 00:13:29.320
Think so?

00:13:29.430 --> 00:13:31.720
No question.
It was all an act!

00:13:32.440 --> 00:13:35.280
She's right. I didn't
look at it that way.

00:13:35.940 --> 00:13:38.880
If she's just pretending to
misunderstand the proposal...

00:13:39.180 --> 00:13:41.340
...then that means the
answer is "no" for now.

00:13:42.350 --> 00:13:43.290
There's still hope!

00:13:43.980 --> 00:13:44.940
Time for school!

00:13:45.850 --> 00:13:48.790
...and he's living in this
glorious luxury condo!

00:13:49.320 --> 00:13:50.520
His folks are rich?

00:13:50.590 --> 00:13:53.350
He has a degree
from a top university!

00:13:53.430 --> 00:13:54.650
Plus, he's gorgeous!

00:13:54.830 --> 00:13:58.130
I'd dump my husband
for him, any day!

00:14:00.330 --> 00:14:02.300
What're you still doin' here?

00:14:02.380 --> 00:14:05.170
What's the long face for
first thing in the morning?

00:14:07.310 --> 00:14:09.410
Don't give up!
You're still young!

00:14:09.780 --> 00:14:11.640
And youth's all you
got going for you!

00:14:13.310 --> 00:14:15.930
Top university--
Wealthy Family--

00:14:16.810 --> 00:14:19.280
Nothing about him
would surprise me now!

00:14:22.550 --> 00:14:24.890
Do I have to
live like this?

00:14:26.560 --> 00:14:28.290
Do what you
can to get by.

00:14:28.960 --> 00:14:30.680
I wish I could
graduate today.

00:14:31.430 --> 00:14:33.800
Why? College students
like us got it good!

00:14:34.510 --> 00:14:37.670
They treat me like a kid.
And I'm always broke.

00:14:37.840 --> 00:14:40.460
But students are the only
guys with a license to loaf.

00:14:44.180 --> 00:14:45.020
Listen--

00:14:46.080 --> 00:14:46.700
Now what?

00:14:47.210 --> 00:14:51.550
You're feasting on your cutlet
set, while all I got is a bun!

00:14:52.790 --> 00:14:53.770
You're not touching it.

00:14:55.130 --> 00:14:56.150
Some friend.

00:14:56.220 --> 00:14:57.390
Every man for himself!

00:14:58.630 --> 00:14:59.890
Could I borrow 300 yen?

00:15:00.640 --> 00:15:02.820
Why didn't ya say
so from the start?

00:15:12.440 --> 00:15:14.430
I should have
borrowed 200 yen more!

00:15:14.750 --> 00:15:15.680
Whatcha doing?

00:15:36.370 --> 00:15:37.340
That feels wonderful.

00:15:45.940 --> 00:15:48.540
I've been thinking of
buying a house lately.

00:15:49.650 --> 00:15:52.640
Really? But isn't your
condominium more convenient?

00:15:53.310 --> 00:15:55.070
While I'm single, sure.

00:15:56.390 --> 00:15:57.780
I'd want a yard, of course.

00:15:57.850 --> 00:15:58.910
How nice.

00:15:59.430 --> 00:16:01.420
The largest one
I can afford.

00:16:03.030 --> 00:16:08.260
I'd like a yard that goes on
forever--and a dog to play in it.

00:16:09.400 --> 00:16:11.440
So you're a dog person, then!

00:16:12.010 --> 00:16:15.950
Sure. Especially the
big ones like Soichiro.

00:16:18.300 --> 00:16:19.670
Yuji! Come back here!

00:16:21.570 --> 00:16:22.130
C'mere!

00:16:22.970 --> 00:16:23.950
He's so cute!

00:16:24.250 --> 00:16:25.410
Sorry!

00:16:26.080 --> 00:16:27.420
Coach Mitaka, look!

00:16:31.480 --> 00:16:34.570
How cute.
Cutest thing I ever saw!

00:16:42.640 --> 00:16:44.160
You won't catch
cold, will you?

00:16:45.700 --> 00:16:46.820
I love the beach.

00:16:50.700 --> 00:16:53.220
You're right.
The beach is wonderful.

00:16:53.680 --> 00:16:54.430
Ms. Otonashi.

00:16:57.940 --> 00:17:00.730
The only dog I want
in my yard is Soichiro.

00:17:07.790 --> 00:17:10.020
You DO understand
what I'm saying?

00:17:10.490 --> 00:17:11.510
Sorrt of--

00:17:11.900 --> 00:17:15.390
You realize that I'm not
asking you for your dog.

00:17:17.340 --> 00:17:19.950
It's my roundabout way
of proposing to a friend.

00:17:21.610 --> 00:17:22.370
I know.

00:17:30.890 --> 00:17:34.910
I--
I don't know what to say--

00:17:34.980 --> 00:17:39.680
I know. But I can wait.
Two, three years, if you need it.

00:17:41.290 --> 00:17:42.060
I'm sorry.

00:17:44.520 --> 00:17:48.540
Hey, in two or three years, maybe
I can get over my dog phobia.

00:18:08.060 --> 00:18:11.120
Young men have
such healthy appetites!

00:18:12.130 --> 00:18:14.820
--He's scarfin' all our food.
--Yosuke!

00:18:17.960 --> 00:18:18.830
That was great!

00:18:19.670 --> 00:18:21.430
Nothing like a
home-cooked meal!

00:18:25.370 --> 00:18:27.450
So what's your
major, Godai?

00:18:28.970 --> 00:18:29.910
Education, sir!

00:18:31.150 --> 00:18:33.110
So, you're planning
to be a teacher?

00:18:33.350 --> 00:18:34.810
No, not exactly.

00:18:35.740 --> 00:18:36.930
A businessman, then?

00:18:38.480 --> 00:18:39.380
I suppose so.

00:18:39.980 --> 00:18:44.120
But my ambitions lie more
toward building a happy home!

00:18:45.680 --> 00:18:48.540
I'd head straight home,
never drinking after work.

00:18:48.790 --> 00:18:51.520
Every day off, I'd
spend with my wife!

00:18:52.100 --> 00:18:55.620
I'd want two children.
A boy and a girl.

00:18:56.570 --> 00:19:00.560
I'd rent some suburban
house with a big yard...

00:19:00.760 --> 00:19:01.740
for a dog.

00:19:02.180 --> 00:19:03.840
I just love dogs!

00:19:05.540 --> 00:19:08.070
You know just what
you want, don't you!

00:19:08.150 --> 00:19:12.640
A man who places his home
before his work is a rare find.

00:19:12.940 --> 00:19:15.180
Not many of them around.

00:19:15.320 --> 00:19:17.970
But that's the man
a woman dreams of!

00:19:18.180 --> 00:19:19.310
So true!

00:19:19.680 --> 00:19:22.850
In any case, a home-first
husband really suits Kozue!

00:19:22.930 --> 00:19:25.860
It's true. Kozue
is so laid-back.

00:19:26.290 --> 00:19:28.190
You don't mind the
"for poorer" part, do ya?

00:19:28.430 --> 00:19:30.670
"Two can live as
cheaply as one," right?

00:19:30.730 --> 00:19:33.140
We could make it a
multi-generational home.

00:19:33.370 --> 00:19:34.830
Yes, indeed!

00:19:36.340 --> 00:19:40.280
But we needn't worry about that
until after he graduates.

00:19:40.740 --> 00:19:45.260
T-That's true. I still got three
years to go. Three long years--

00:19:54.430 --> 00:19:57.250
Stop asking that,
Mrs. Ichinose!

00:19:57.600 --> 00:20:00.390
Hey, it's not just
me who wants to know.

00:20:01.030 --> 00:20:02.370
So what happened??

00:20:02.640 --> 00:20:05.190
We went to the beach
and talked about dogs.

00:20:05.410 --> 00:20:07.870
You mean he
didn't propose?

00:20:09.200 --> 00:20:11.490
He did, didn't he?

00:20:11.580 --> 00:20:13.070
Manager!

00:20:14.580 --> 00:20:16.230
Public baths again?

00:20:16.880 --> 00:20:18.140
You gotta hear this!

00:20:18.710 --> 00:20:20.410
Shall we go, Godai?

00:20:20.510 --> 00:20:21.230
Uh, sure!

00:20:21.950 --> 00:20:22.890
Is something wrong?

00:20:22.950 --> 00:20:24.000
Nothing at all!

00:20:25.180 --> 00:20:26.150
They got away.

00:20:26.830 --> 00:20:27.980
Say, Ma?

00:20:29.750 --> 00:20:31.980
Dad proposed to
you, too, right?

00:20:32.330 --> 00:20:35.060
I didn't get proposed to.
I did the proposing!

00:20:36.930 --> 00:20:37.690
I knew it!

00:20:40.030 --> 00:20:41.830
Mrs. Ichinose
wouldn't let up.

00:20:42.340 --> 00:20:45.260
She just can't resist
spreading rumors.

00:20:46.580 --> 00:20:47.930
Who'd bother with me?

00:20:49.820 --> 00:20:50.910
I'd bother, a lot!

00:20:55.010 --> 00:20:58.380
It doesn't matter
what I say right now.

00:21:06.290 --> 00:21:10.890
In time, it might be
different, but now--

00:21:13.070 --> 00:21:14.090
"In time"?

00:21:26.280 --> 00:21:27.310
Three more years.

00:21:29.780 --> 00:21:33.380
You can be manager for
another three years, right?

00:21:34.090 --> 00:21:35.770
Three years?

00:21:41.640 --> 00:21:44.160
Yes! In three years...

00:21:49.080 --> 00:21:50.790
C'mon, I'll race you home!

00:21:51.240 --> 00:21:55.540
...the memoy of Soichiro will
flow away like the sands of time.

00:21:56.210 --> 00:21:56.690
And then--

00:21:57.850 --> 00:21:58.610
And then--

00:22:20.570 --> 00:22:22.930
And what'll be different
three years from now!?

00:22:23.110 --> 00:22:25.690
You naive young man!

00:22:27.310 --> 00:22:33.530
Graduation will provide you a rosy
future? Is that your delusion?

00:22:33.820 --> 00:22:37.310
Are you really plannin' to
graduate in only three years?

00:22:37.390 --> 00:22:39.350
Well, young man!?

00:22:41.750 --> 00:22:46.210
You could get held back. You
could bounce your tuition check.

00:22:46.430 --> 00:22:51.420
Provided you graduate, how do
you intend to support a family?

00:22:51.640 --> 00:22:55.090
You know what you want
but you got no way to get there.

00:22:55.180 --> 00:22:56.140
Indubitably.

00:23:04.080 --> 00:23:05.130
Good morning, Soichiro!

00:23:12.330 --> 00:23:13.680
Good morning!

00:23:15.360 --> 00:23:16.850
G-Good mornin'.

00:23:21.460 --> 00:23:22.330
Godai?

00:23:24.530 --> 00:23:25.660
Are you okay?

00:23:26.640 --> 00:23:27.490
Manager--

00:23:28.030 --> 00:23:28.510
Yes?

00:23:30.500 --> 00:23:33.370
Let's make it five years.
Five more years.

00:23:34.000 --> 00:23:34.790
I'm off!

00:23:50.360 --> 00:23:53.440
I got a call from an old
friend to meet in town.

00:23:54.460 --> 00:23:59.060
A few memories, her child's smile
then I climbed back up Clock Hill.

00:23:59.410 --> 00:24:00.390
"Remarriage."

00:24:00.910 --> 00:24:04.430
Next: "Godai's Out of It!
Kyoko's on the Rampage"

00:24:04.970 --> 00:24:06.930
And today I'll climb
Clock Hill again.
